title: Short-left Sep 26
---
pub_date: 2026-10-01
---
body:
<figure>
  <img src="./panorama.jpeg" alt="Umhlanga Beach"">
</figure>

Last weekend we drove out to Umhlanga, mostly just to sit and stare at the water for a while...
I have to say... there's something about that coast, the sea moves so slow and steady it almost
feels like it's breathing. No traffic, no notifications, just that same wave coming in over and over.

Someone said... ***"meditation and water are wedded for ever..."***

and I used to think that was just a pretty line you know... just english...
But standing on that beach I got it... for the first time.... I got it...

Some things you cannot really understand until the ocean makes you sit still long enough to feel them.